  "title": "Cavatelli and Broccoli",
  "description": "This cavatelli and broccoli dish features blanched florets sautéed in garlicky olive oil, then tossed with hot pasta, red pepper flakes, and Parmesan.",
  "authors": [
    "linda m"
  ],
